message: "If you use this software, please cite this archived software release and the BOLD methods paper."
title: "BOLD/BOIN Research Simulator"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
authors:
  - family-names: Guo
    given-names: Wanru
    affiliation: "University of Maryland Greenebaum Comprehensive Cancer Center"
  - family-names: Wang
