    affiliation: "University of Maryland School of Medicine"
abstract: >-
  An independent research Shiny application for comparing operating
  characteristics of the Bayesian Ordered Lattice Design (BOLD) and the
  Bayesian Optimal Interval (BOIN) design in a four-dose Phase I setting.
  The software is intended for simulation and design review, not for live
  clinical dose assignment.
keywords:
  - Phase I clinical trial
  - maximum tolerated dose
  - dose finding
  - BOLD
  - BOIN
  - Shiny
